        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on pilot scope, farmer journeys, and core services for the hub.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello team, welcome to the kickoff for the Integrated Rural Service Hub Pilot. Our goal is to design and launch this hub in 30 days. To start, I'd like to get everyone's input on the core needs of our local farmers. This will help us define the farmer journeys for T1. @59001, what are the most common challenges you see?",
            "mentions": [
              59001,
              83675,
              200052,
              359687
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "wave",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Hi. Farmers mostly need help with their crops. Things like soil health and knowing the best time to harvest. They also have trouble getting supplies.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "That's a great starting point. To make this actionable for T1, could we define two or three key farmer profiles? For example, 'smallholder vegetable farmer' or 'dairy farmer'. That will help us map their specific journeys.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Yes, we have many small vegetable farms. And some who raise a few cattle. Those are the main two types.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "seedling",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "And they will need financial services. Small loans for seeds and equipment. We should make sure that's a core offering.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 200052,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Offering loans means a lot of paperwork. We need to be sure we follow all the rules.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Excellent points on finance and compliance. Let's first lock in the farmer profiles for D2. Based on the input, how about we focus on: 1. 'Smallholder Vegetable Farmer' and 2. 'Small-Scale Livestock Farmer'. Does everyone agree?",
            "mentions": [
              59001
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D2"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Yes, those two profiles cover most people.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Works for me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "Great, D2 is confirmed. Now for the core services for D1. I propose we start with a focused list for the pilot: 1. Agronomic Advisory (for T9), 2. Financial Service Intake (like loan applications), and 3. Administrative Support (help with official forms). This will form the basis of our service model in A1.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9",
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "For agronomic advice, we can prepare standard info on fertilisation and plant health. That would be very useful.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M12",
            "speaker_id": 200052,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "Which official forms will we help with? We need to know so we can prepare.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M13",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M12",
            "text": "Let's start with the most common ones: land registration and subsidy applications. We can expand later. So, to confirm D1, the core services are: Agronomic Advisory, Financial Intake, and Admin Support. Any final thoughts or objections?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M14",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "Just a note that 'Financial Intake' implies cash handling procedures will be needed. But the service list itself is fine from my perspective.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "The list looks good. It's a strong start.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "I agree.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M17",
            "speaker_id": 200052,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "Ok.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M18",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "Perfect, we have our decisions. I'll summarize: D1 is our core service list and D2 is our primary farmer profiles. This concludes our initial alignment. I will begin drafting the high-level process map for T2. @59001, can you please start working on the farmer communication plan for T5 and the associated guidelines in A3?",
            "mentions": [
              59001
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2",
              "T5",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1",
              "D2"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 2
              }
