      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Agree on staffing model, shifts, and daily operational routines.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, for T4, I've drafted a staffing model and schedule. Proposal: two staff members on-site during operating hours, one focused on agronomy/admin and the other on financial services. I suggest hours of 7am - 4pm to align with peak farming schedules. Looking for feedback to finalize D5.",
            "mentions": [
              59001,
              83675,
              359687
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "7am seems very early. Farmers are in their fields then. Maybe we should open at 9am when they come to town?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "I think 7am could be good. They might stop by on their way to the fields or to the market.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "This is a key assumption we need to test. How about this: we start with 7am-4pm for the first week of the pilot, track visitor times closely in A4, and adjust if needed. Can we agree on that as our starting schedule for D5?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "Ok, we can try that and see.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "The two-person model is fine, but we need clear emergency roles, especially with cash on site. This relates to T7 and T10.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7",
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "Agreed. That leads us to daily routines for D6. I've started a draft 'Daily Opening and Closing Operational Checklist' (A7). It covers basic operational and financial checks. @359687, could you review it and add the necessary security procedures?",
            "mentions": [
              359687
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Of course. I'll add points for checking locks, securing the cashbox, and a quick premises sweep at open and close. I can get that done today.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 200052,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Should staff sign a logbook when they arrive and leave?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "We can probably just use system login times to track that. It's less paperwork.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Let's stick with system logs to keep things simple. So, to confirm D6, we are agreed on implementing the daily checklist A7, which will include operational, financial, and security routines. Is everyone aligned?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
