      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Lock in safety, crowd management, and incident response procedures.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, for T7, I have drafted the 'Safety, Crowd Management, and Incident Response Plan' now available at A6. It covers procedures for managing visitor flow, cash handling security per T10, and emergency response. Please review and provide your feedback.",
            "mentions": [
              88246,
              83675,
              200052,
              59001
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "T7",
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Thanks for preparing this. The plan is comprehensive. One clarification on the incident response: for financial discrepancies, you've listed 'contact branch manager'. Can we specify the primary contact and an escalation path in case they are unavailable?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M54",
            "text": "Good point. I will update it to specify 'Contact on-duty Branch Manager first; escalate to Regional Operations Director if unavailable'. I'll add the director's contact details.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M56",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "What is the procedure for a medical issue? Is there a first-aid kit on site?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M57",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "Yes, the plan notes the location of the first-aid kit. The procedure is to call emergency services immediately for any serious issue, provide basic aid if trained, and then report the incident.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "What if farmers get into a heated argument? It can happen.",
