          {
            "msg_id": "M69",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "Thanks for the update. To help us make an informed decision for D8, I've pulled some key metrics from our tracking sheet A4:\n- Total unique farmer visits: 152\n- Service usage: 75% Agronomic, 15% Financial, 10% Admin\n- Average satisfaction score: 4.2 out of 5\n- Incidents: 3 minor disputes, all resolved without escalation.\nThe data looks strong, especially the satisfaction score. What are everyone's initial thoughts on these results?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M70",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "The farmers I spoke with were very happy with the agronomy advice. They said it saved them a long trip. We should definitely keep that going.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M71",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "The financial service uptake is lower than I hoped. Do we know why? Was the process too difficult or did we not communicate it well enough?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M72",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "From a safety and operations perspective, the pilot was a success. The procedures we put in place held up well, even on busy days. I see no operational barriers to continuing.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M73",
            "speaker_id": 200052,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "We had some compliance issues at the beginning with farmers not bringing the right documents, but that improved over time. The process seems to work now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M74",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M71",
            "text": "That's a great question. My hypothesis is that financial services require more trust, which takes longer than 30 days to build. The core agronomic service is a strong foundation. Based on this, I recommend we don't scale to new locations yet, but instead extend the pilot for another 6 months. This gives us time to build that trust and actively promote the financial and admin services.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M75",
            "speaker_id": 59001,
            "reply_to": "M74",
            "text": "Extending for 6 months makes sense.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M76",
            "speaker_id": 83675,
            "reply_to": "M74",
            "text": "I agree. That gives us a fair chance to see if the financial services can grow.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M77",
            "speaker_id": 359687,
            "reply_to": "M74",
            "text": "The current model is sustainable for a longer period. I support an extension.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M78",
            "speaker_id": 200052,
            "reply_to": "M74",
            "text": "So the decision is to extend, not to open new hubs yet?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M79",
            "speaker_id": 88246,
            "reply_to": "M78",
            "text": "Correct. Let's formalize the decision for D8: 'Recommend a 6-month pilot extension to mature service uptake, particularly for financial and admin services, before re-evaluating for a broader scale-up.' Does everyone agree to this being our official recommendation in the A8 report?",
            "mentions": [],
